data: {"id": "62160fb888f94249-thinking-parallel_evidence-733", "run_id": "62160fb888f94249", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已收到预采集的 baseline 结果，其中 logging 维度已经提供了关键证据（`/opt/app/unavailable-command: not found`）。现在需要并行完成 Kubernetes 维度的 e1-e4 采集，并用 Prometheus range 查询确认重启趋势。\n\n**执行计划**：\n1.  **e1**: `kubectl describe pod` — 确认 Exit Code、Reason、Last State。\n2.  **e3**: `kubectl get pod -o yaml` — 确认 command/args/image 定义。\n3.  **e4**: `kubectl_events` — 确认事件中的 Killing 原因。\n4.  **e2**: `kubectl_previous_logs` — 确认 kubectl 侧的 previous log 是否也捕获到 `exec: not found`。\n5.  **Metrics Trend**: `execute_pod_promql` range query — 确认重启趋势", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789134340381, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

